  "description": "Semgrep catches security vulnerabilities in real-time and guides Claude to write secure code from the start.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **4 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `install-mfw` (Install the mfw (Semgrep Malware Firewall) CLI via the curl|sh installer and walk the user through setup —…)\n- **Hooks** (4): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `guardian`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install semgrep@claude-plugins-official` from `semgrep/mcp-marketplace` (`plugin`).",
